%% PASS5
#north-south-passage
(room *)
(name *)	North-South Passage
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a high north-south passage, which forks to the northeast.
(from * go #north to #chasm)
(from * go #northeast to #loud-room)
(from * go #south to #round-room)

%% CHAS1
#chasm
(room *)
(name *)	Chasm
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	A chasm runs southwest to northeast. You are on the south edge; the path
	exits to the south and to the east.
(from * go #south to #deep-ravine)
(from * go #east to #north-south-passage)
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	Are you out of your mind?

%% CAVE3
#damp-cave
(room *)
(name *)	Damp Cave
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a cave. Passages exit to the south and to the east, but the
	cave narrows to a crack to the west. The earth is particularly damp
	here.
(from * go #south to #loud-room)
(from * go #east to #dam-room)
(narrate failing to leave * #west)
	It is too narrow for most insects.

%% CHAS3
#ancient-chasm
(room *)
(name *)	Ancient Chasm
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	A chasm, evidently produced by an ancient river, runs through the cave
	here. Passages lead off in all directions.
(from * go #south to #loud-room)
(from * go #east to #small-cave)
(from * go #north to #dead-end6)
(from * go #west to #dead-end7)

